{"version":1,"content":"<p>「無綫新咪神」之稱的鄧凱文（Eris），向來不吝嗇驕人身材，經常在社交平台分享靚相向粉絲派福利。</p><p>她昨日（17日）再度上載一輯全新戶外寫真，大晒白滑香肩與一雙逆天長腿，瞬間俘虜大批網民，引發熱烈討論。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:23:58.593648+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:14.758586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:14.758586+00:00","content_hash":"d9322fb033c3ce239941f0d24f9cda2ca02c6f5bda2b91469b5ee61cbde6f5a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}